      "content": "i know, i should probably ask a doctor but i can't get a hold of anyone tonight and the presentation is literally in 12 hours. plus my asthma is usually really mild, i haven't needed an inhaler in months. wouldn't a small dose, like like 10mg, be safe enough that it wouldn't hit my lungs? i just really need to stop the physical shaking so i dont look like a mess.",
